    {
      "id": "KJ0PK4-fqV3KLe-6JZQmY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 207,
      "y": 539.5,
      "width": 757.8994140625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ag",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 222570986,
      "version": 282,
      "versionNonce": 1595038058,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776671456077,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. As users increase, load on server increases and impacts response times\n2. We can either increase capacity on the same server (Vertical Scaling) or \n    add more servers which can handle requests efficiently (Horizontal Scaling)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. As users increase, load on server increases and impacts response times\n2. We can either increase capacity on the same server (Vertical Scaling) or \n    add more servers which can handle requests efficiently (Horizontal Scaling)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GLfWPO4cEBcydt_04zVH2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1068,
      "y": 169.5,
      "width": 653.7195434570312,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ah",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 451315434,
      "version": 459,
      "versionNonce": 761927286,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776672179640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Horizontal Scaling:\n\n1. Load Balancing Required\n2. Resilient (if one server fails, other servers can handle requests)\n3. Network Calls (RPC) [between servers/services]\n4. Data Inconsistency\n5. Scales well (As users increase)\n\nVertical Scaling:\n\n1. No Load Balancing\n2. Single point of failure\n3. Inter process communication (comparitively fast)\n4. Consistent (Data is consistent)\n5. Hardware limit",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Horizontal Scaling:\n\n1. Load Balancing Required\n2. Resilient (if one server fails, other servers can handle requests)\n3. Network Calls (RPC) [between servers/services]\n4. Data Inconsistency\n5. Scales well (As users increase)\n\nVertical Scaling:\n\n1. No Load Balancing\n2. Single point of failure\n3. Inter process communication (comparitively fast)\n4. Consistent (Data is consistent)\n5. Hardware limit",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
